# Privacy Policy

**Effective Date:** August 18, 2026

## 1. Information We Collect
To function correctly, the Bot may collect and process certain data when you interact with it or use its commands within Discord. This may include:
* **Discord User IDs and Usernames:** To identify players, track stats, and manage permissions.
* **Discord Server (Guild) IDs:** To configure settings and features specific to authorized servers.
* **Command Inputs & Interaction Data:** Data explicitly provided by you when executing commands or configuring features.

## 2. How We Use Information
The information collected is used strictly for:
* Operating and providing the core features of the Bot (such as tracking game statistics and handling user interactions).
* Maintaining application security and debugging errors.

## 3. Data Storage and Security
We take reasonable measures to protect any processed data from unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure. Data is only retained for as long as necessary to provide the functionality of the Bot.

## 4. Third-Party Services
The Bot interacts with official platform APIs (such as the Discord API and relevant gaming APIs) to fetch data. These third-party services operate under their own privacy policies. We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your data to outside commercial parties.

## 5. Changes to This Policy
We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.

## 6. Contact
If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out via the community support channels associated with the Bot.
